GOAL:
{'id': 'ai-02-embedding-index-migration', 'description': 'Migrate a 500M-vector embedding index from Pinecone to a self-hosted Qdrant cluster. Must: provision Qdrant cluster (3 nodes, replicated), rebuild the index from source data (text embeddings via OpenAI ada-002), set up dual-query (Pinecone + Qdrant) with result parity verification, backfill any new vectors added during migration, cutover application queries from Pinecone to Qdrant, and verify search quality (recall@k ≥ 0.98). Risk factors: index rebuild taking > 48 hours, parity skew from different distance metrics, Qdrant cluster not handling production query load, cutover gap missing vectors. Tools available: Qdrant, OpenAI API, Python, kubectl, Helm.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'production', 'tools': ['Qdrant', 'OpenAI API', 'Python', 'kubectl']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'strict', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

prompt_full_text:
--- system ---
